@@ -3,6 +3,9 @@
 Unreleased
 
 - Fix `copy.deepcopy()` and `pickle` on a `Parameter`, `Option` or `Command`. {pr}`3805`
+- Fix a race condition in {meth}`Command.main` where a `KeyboardInterrupt` or
+  `EOFError` arriving while the abort/error message was being written could
+  escape unhandled instead of exiting with the intended code. {issue}`3802`
 
 ## Version 8.5.0
 
